also apply to Status Holders.', 'Authorisation in Excess of Entitlement governs how DGFT business controls should be applied, validated, and enforced.', 'Authorisation in Excess of Entitlement explains the operating rule set that DEKAI should enforce. Key control points include 4.13 Authorisation in Excess of Entitlement
