shall pay duty saved amount along with interest on inputs, as applicable as
notified by Do R.');
INSERT INTO conditions (section_code, condition_text) VALUES ('4.15', 'In cases of domestically procured inputs, the amount to be
paid shall be based on exemptions/refund availed on customs
duty/taxes/cess by the domestic supplier.');
INSERT INTO conditions (section_code, condition_text) VALUES ('4.15', '(iii) Applicant shall deposit amount as per paragraph 4.49(a)(ii) of HBP in case
