reviewed. The section also drives actions such as Exporters are required to submit revised data in ANF 4B for such revision..', 'Indha Revision of SION by NC section-la, Revision of SION by NC explains the operating rule set that DEKAI should enforce. Key control points include 4.25 Revision of SION by NC
