Ahmedabad, Bangalore, Bhubaneshwar, Calicut Airport (Kerala), Chennai,
Coimbatore Air Cargo Complex, Dabolim (Goa), Delhi, Hyderabad, Indore,
Jaipur, Kochi, Kolkata, Lucknow (Amausi), Mumbai, Nagpur, Rajasansi
(Amritsar), Srinagar, Trivandrum, Varanasi, Vishakhapatnam.
ICDs:
