the date of import of each consignment against Authorisation.', 'Exports against Advance Authorisation governs how DGFT business controls should be applied, validated, and enforced.', 'Exports against Advance Authorisation explains the operating rule set that DEKAI should enforce. Key control points include 4.84 Exports against Advance Authorisation
